ng an eye, an ear, a head, and a hand. The text reads: Be an a11y. Sound isnt always heard. Captions and transcripts make content work for every\one. There is a logo at the bottom and a QR code that takes you to design system dot n y dot gov slash a 1 1 y␀)/ID(AD240722-1046-24.2.20964-ADBE-000000006386)/K 0/P 355 0 R/Pg 7 0 R/S/Figure>>endobj440 0 obj<</BBox[17.7593 17.7915 594.216 774.241]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>endobj7 0 obj<</BleedBox[0.0 0.0 612.0 792.0]/Contents 8 0 R/CropBox[0.0 0.0 612.0 792.0]/LastModified(D:20260514102151-04'00')/MediaBox[0.0 0.0 612.0 792.0]/Parent 450 0 R/Resources<</ExtGState<</GS0 462 0 R>>>>/Rotate 0/StructParents 4/Tabs/S/TrimBox[0.0 0.0 612.0 792.0]/Type/Page>>endobj8 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 54672>>stream
